                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3afdb3b8-2fef-467e-acda-40462202ae0a",
                                "sense_id": "d23eb32a-f1a9-3a89-b5f0-c9eb153bca41",
                                "text": "В предме́тах ему́ броса́лись в глаза́ неиспра́вности и ра́довали его́. Когда́ он проходи́л ми́мо прямостоя́щего и чи́стого столба́, ему́ хоте́лось покриви́ть его́ и́ли испа́костить.",
                                "translation": "All objects revealed their imperfections to him and their imperfections gave him pleasure. When he walked past an erect and clean column, he had a desire to make it crooked and to bespatter it with filth.",
                                "english": "All objects revealed their imperfections to him and their imperfections gave him pleasure. When he walked past an erect and clean column, he had a desire to make it crooked and to bespatter it with filth."
